<title>HUNGARY: CESI index closes down by one percent.</title>
<headline>CESI index closes down by one percent.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index dropped 16.29 points or 1.09 percent to end at 1,471.66 points on Wednesday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungrian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
